data: {"type":"response.function_call_arguments.done","sequence_number":454,"item_id":"fc_076e23f72da9efbf016adb39e5af2c8191a9efde678dad5e0a","output_index":5,"arguments":"{\"artifact_json\":\"{\\\"target_review\\\":{\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"PASS\\\",\\\"notes\\\":\\\"Compared problem.md lines 3-5 with source-context.md lines 9-13, 14-40 and 42-53, and spec.json lines 4-45. The spec preserves the exercise and its supplied interpretation: arbitrary prime p, field K of characteristic p, integer lambda with 0<=lambda<p, arbitrary admissible lattice M, scalar extension, and irreducibility as nonzero with every invariant subspace zero or full. H001-H004 cover the prime, characteristic, range, representation and lattice assumptions; no conclusion has been promoted to a hypothesis. In particular lambda=0 and p=2 are included. The one-target scope is maintained.\\\",\\\"locations\\\":[\\\"problem.md:3-5\\\",\\\"source-context.md:9-13,14-40,42-53\\\",\\\"spec.json:4-45\\\",\\\"nl0.json:7-69\\\"]},\\\"definition_reviews\\\":{},\\\"source_reviews\\\":{},\\\"structure_review\\\":{\\\"verdict\\\":\\\"PASS\\\",\\\"notes\\\":\\\"The canonical graph has exactly the four H roots and target P, one inference R001 producing P, and R001 directly uses all four H nodes. There are no internal propositions, external/mathlib propositions, or global D definitions; the backward closure of P includes every retained proposition. The single inference has a coherent ordered argument S001-S005 and its local F001 is produced in S003 before use in S004; no graph cycle or disconnected branch is present. This is a global graph/AND-closure inspection, not a packet replay or a certification of a mechanical checker run. The visible proof route addresses endpoints and degenerate cases (including lambda=0, p=2), avoids reliance on distinct reduced h-weights, and its matrix-unit argument applies to arbitrary W. No blocking global inconsistency identified. Per-inference packet replay remains outside this stage.\\\",\\\"locations\\\":[\\\"nl0.json:57-70\\\",\\\"nl0.json:72-85\\\",\\\"nl0.json:357-503\\\",\\\"spec.json:46-46\\\",\\\"signature-evidence.json:1\\\"]},\\\"findings\\\":[]}\"}"}

